---
import { Button } from "components/ui/button";
import { Input } from "components/ui/input";
import { Badge } from "components/ui/badge";
import {
  CircleIcon,
  FileTextIcon,
  ListChecksIcon,
  ArrowRightIcon,
} from "lucide-react";
---

<section
  id="top"
  class="relative grid gap-12 pb-24 pt-20 md:grid-cols-[1.05fr_.95fr] md:items-center md:gap-16 md:pb-32 md:pt-28"
>
  <div class="relative z-10">
    <Badge variant="outline" className="bg-card"> Coming Soon </Badge>
    <h1
      class="max-w-3xl text-balance font-sans text-5xl font-semibold leading-[1.03] tracking-[-0.055em] sm:text-7xl lg:text-[5.8rem]"
    >
      Meetings that<br /><span class="text-primary">ship the work.</span>
    </h1>
    <p
      class="mt-7 max-w-xl text-pretty text-lg leading-7 text-muted-foreground sm:text-xl"
    >
      Quorum brings your team and specialized AI engineering agents into the
      same room. Leave with the context, decisions, and next steps already
      written.
    </p>
    <form id="join" class="mt-9 flex max-w-md flex-col gap-3 sm:flex-row">
      <label for="email" class="sr-only">Work email</label>
      <Input
        id="email"
        type="email"
        required
        placeholder="email@address.com"
        className="h-12 min-w-0 flex-1 rounded-lg border border-input bg-card px-4 text-sm outline-none ring-offset-background placeholder:text-muted-foreground focus-visible:ring-2 focus-visible:ring-ring"
      />
      <Button
        type="submit"
        className="flex h-12 items-center justify-center gap-2 rounded-lg bg-primary px-5 text-sm font-medium text-primary-foreground transition-transform hover:-translate-y-0.5 cursor-pointer"
        >Join the waitlist <ArrowRightIcon size={16} /></Button
      >
    </form>
    <p class="mt-3 font-mono text-[11px] text-muted-foreground">
      No spam. Just a note when your team&apos;s spot is ready.
    </p>
  </div>

  <div class="relative mx-auto w-full max-w-lg md:mt-4">
    <div
      class="absolute -inset-5 rounded-4xl bg-accent/10 blur-2xl"
      aria-hidden="true"
    >
    </div>
    <div
      class="relative rounded-2xl border border-border bg-card p-4 shadow-2xl shadow-primary/10 sm:p-6"
    >
      <div
        class="flex items-center justify-between border-b border-border pb-4 font-mono text-[11px] text-muted-foreground"
      >
        <span>ROOM / #platform-architecture</span><span
          class="flex items-center gap-1.5 text-accent"
          ><CircleIcon size={7} /> LIVE</span
        >
      </div>
      <div class="py-7">
        <div class="mb-6 flex items-center gap-3">
          <div class="flex -space-x-2">
            <span
              class="flex size-9 items-center justify-center rounded-full border-2 border-card bg-primary text-xs text-primary-foreground"
              >AM</span
            ><span
              class="flex size-9 items-center justify-center rounded-full border-2 border-card bg-accent text-xs text-accent-foreground"
              >JD</span
            ><span
              class="flex size-9 items-center justify-center rounded-full border-2 border-card bg-secondary text-xs text-secondary-foreground"
              >+3</span
            >
          </div><span class="text-sm text-muted-foreground"
            >5 people + 2 agents</span
          >
        </div><div class="space-y-3">
          <div class="flex gap-3">
            <span class="mt-1 size-2 shrink-0 rounded-full bg-accent"
            ></span><div>
              <p class="text-sm font-medium">
                Should we split the ingestion service?
              </p><p class="mt-1 text-xs leading-5 text-muted-foreground">
                Architect is listening · 02:14
              </p>
            </div>
          </div><div
            class="ml-5 rounded-lg border border-border bg-muted/50 p-3 text-xs leading-5 text-muted-foreground"
          >
            Based on current throughput, a queue boundary buys us isolation
            without adding operational overhead.
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div
        class="grid grid-cols-3 gap-2 border-t border-border pt-4 text-center font-mono text-[10px] text-muted-foreground"
      >
        <span class="flex flex-col items-center gap-2"
          ><FileTextIcon size={16} /> TRANSCRIPT</span
        ><span class="flex flex-col items-center gap-2"
          ><ListChecksIcon size={16} /> DECISIONS</span
        ><span class="flex flex-col items-center gap-2"
          ><ArrowRightIcon size={16} /> ACTIONS</span
        >
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
